        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Brian Griffin, Seth MacFarlane, Max Charles\n- Characters: Glenn Quagmire\n- Works: Family Guy, \"Tiegs for Two\", Ted\n- Topics: Voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- Glenn Quagmire is the Griffins' sex-crazed neighbor in Family Guy.\n- Brian Griffin seeks Glenn Quagmire out for advice in the Family Guy episode \"Tiegs for Two\".\n- Seth MacFarlane voices Glenn Quagmire in Family Guy.\n- Seth MacFarlane created the 2012 film Ted.\n- Max Charles appears in the 2012 film Ted.",
